    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Gravenfall: Veil of Darkness</i>, you play as a young hero tasked with lifting a terrible curse that has befallen the village of Gravenfall. The curse emanates from the ominous <strong>Wraithwood Tower</strong>, and its dark magic slowly consumes the land. The village elder, <strong>Maelis</strong>, reveals that a powerful sorcerer within the tower is responsible, and sends you on a dangerous journey to discover how to break it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278390/extras/2e27b23fc5673e17e3ca5d4442babcdf.avif?t=1732744438\" data-has-big width=800 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your quest, you\u2019ll gather resources by <strong>mining</strong>, <strong>cutting down trees</strong>, and <strong>skinning animals</strong> to craft new weapons and armor. <strong>Fishing</strong> provides a way to earn money, and cooked fish can offer valuable health boosts in and out of combat. There are also secrets to uncover, like a <strong>fabled talisman</strong> that can either cure or curse those who possess it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll face unique challenges, like <strong>picking locks</strong> to open hidden rooms and buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, battle, and uncover the mysteries of Gravenfall, but beware\u2014dark magic is always watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 4-8 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Gravenfall: Veil of Darkness</i>, you play as a young hero tasked with lifting a terrible curse that has befallen the village of Gravenfall. The curse emanates from the ominous <strong>Wraithwood Tower</strong>, and its dark magic slowly consumes the land. The village elder, <strong>Maelis</strong>, reveals that a powerful sorcerer within the tower is responsible, and sends you on a dangerous journey to discover how to break it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278390/extras/2e27b23fc5673e17e3ca5d4442babcdf.avif?t=1732744438\" data-has-big width=800 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your quest, you\u2019ll gather resources by <strong>mining</strong>, <strong>cutting down trees</strong>, and <strong>skinning animals</strong> to craft new weapons and armor. <strong>Fishing</strong> provides a way to earn money, and cooked fish can offer valuable health boosts in and out of combat. There are also secrets to uncover, like a <strong>fabled talisman</strong> that can either cure or curse those who possess it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll face unique challenges, like <strong>picking locks</strong> to open hidden rooms and buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, battle, and uncover the mysteries of Gravenfall, but beware\u2014dark magic is always watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 4-8 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Gravenfall: Veil of Darkness combines turn-based combat with puzzle-solving in a story-driven adventure. Battle cursed creatures, uncover relics, and unravel the tragic tale of love, betrayal, and dark magic at the core of Gravenfall\u2019s curse.",
